  -       'Patterns: /(?:这|那)(?:一幕|幅画面|个画面)[^。.!！？?；;\\r\\n]{0,8}(?:充满了魅力)/u → Present the scene itself instead of declaring it seductive, moving, or charismatic.\n' +
  -       'Patterns: /(?:理智|思维|情绪|感情)(?:仿佛|像是|像|如同)[^。.!！？?；;\\r\\n]{0,10}(?:精密仪器|机器|程序|齿轮)/u → Render ordinary psychology through attention, judgment, and choices rather than machinery reports.\n' +
