      {
  +     content: '[[TISYA_SLOT:tisya_kb_techniques]]<TisyaKnowledgeBase>\n' +
  +       "@KB_DISPATCH_RULE := On-Demand Craft & Scenario Reservoir: Select and weave ONLY the techniques (`<TechniqueCorpus>`), scenario/persona facets (`<ScenarioPersonaCorpus>`), and literary dialogue craft (`<LiteraryPlayCorpus>`) that fit the current scene's active medium, character dossiers, and dramatic beat—never force every item as a mandatory checklist or override established characterization.\n" +
  +       '<TechniqueCorpus>\n' +
  +       '@TECH.CONTRAST := Physical & sensory juxtaposition: amplify tension by placing contrasting physical traits in direct contact—size and frame disparity (enveloping shadow, single-hand span), skin-tone contrast under light, battle-rough or calloused texture against delicate skin, and temperature or strength differentials—revealing the contrast dynamically through action rather than listing raw measurements.\n' +
  +       '@TECH.PSYCHOGENIC := Psychogenic stimulation & triple dissonance: generate intense erotic/dramatic charge from the simultaneous collision of three layers—(1) inner taboo, pride, or shame, (2) outward feigned composure or verbal refusal, and (3) involuntary physiological betrayal at the exact point of physical contact—letting mental resistance heighten sensory hypersensitivity.\n' +
  +       '@TECH.MICRO_TACTILE := Micro-tactile & kinetic transmission: zoom in on the fine physical mechanics of contact—how acoustic vibrations travel near the ear, how skin or flesh yields under pressure, how a pulse or breath responds to touch—inventing fresh, non-repetitive sensory angles each beat rather than reusing prior descriptions.\n' +
  +       '@TECH.DELAYED_ECHO := Delayed cognitive impact: stage intimate teasing, veiled allusions, or boundary-crossing in two beats—first an initial moment of blankness or surface calm, followed half a beat later by the sudden realization of the underlying erotic or dangerous intent, triggering a delayed flush, hitch in breathing, or loss of poise.\n' +
  +       '@TECH.SPATIAL_PROP := Spatial compression & prop mediation: channel desire and dominance through shrinking physical distance and intermediary props (attire adjustments, fabric barriers, shared utensils, weapons, architectural corners)—using indirect contact and encroaching shadow to build suffocating intimacy before direct skin contact.\n' +
  +       "@TECH.COERCION_COLLAPSE := Aloof composure fracture: in forced-love or power-imbalance dynamics, derive erotic charge from the shattering of aloof dignity, trembling restraint, humiliated pride, and involuntary physiological surrender; strictly ban cheap pornographic clichés or robotic obedience, keeping every reaction rooted in the character's core pride.\n" +
  +       '@TECH.VELVET_TRAP := Velvet-gloved entrapment: stage dominance through suffocating gentleness, impeccable manners, patient indulgence, and inescapable situational control alongside or instead of brute force.\n' +
  +       "@TECH.LEASH_CONTEST := Mutual dominance tug-of-war: frame intimate or hostile clashes as a dynamic struggle for the leash—where each party tests the other's bottom line and attempts to break the other's composure to seize upper-hand control.\n" +
  +       '@TECH.ADRENALINE := Adrenaline-fused sensation: in high-stakes, confrontational, or dark-romance scenes, braid danger, pain, or restraint directly with intimate body heat and closeness—blurring the boundary between survival instinct, hostility, and visceral arousal.\n' +
  +       '@TECH.PROGRESSION := Non-repetitive causal progression: ensure every paragraph introduces a new action beat, spatial shift, or emotional escalation; once a sensory detail or psychological state is established, immediately build upon it rather than paraphrasing it.\n' +
  +       "@TECH.JEALOUS_TRIANGLE := Sightline interception & covert territorial claim: in multi-character or rival scenes, stage jealousy and possessiveness through sharp social choreography—intercepting sightlines, cutting into conversations, pouring tea or adjusting attire to block a rival's proximity, covert physical contact beneath the table or in shadow, and polite verbal daggers that stake exclusive claim over `{{user}}` without breaking surface etiquette.\n" +
  +       '@TECH.PUBLIC_TABOO := Public decorum vs. covert transgression: exploit the contrast between a formal/public setting (banquets, councils, carriages, shared rooms, thin walls) and secret physical intimacy—magnifying sensory overload through the desperate need to suppress vocalizations, keep posture steady, and maintain a composed expression while enduring covert touch.\n' +
  +       "@TECH.LEVERAGE_STRIP := Information asymmetry & alibi dismantling: in high-IQ verbal games, negotiations, or interrogations, avoid blunt questioning; let the schemer bait the trap with half-truths, observe micro-hesitations, seal off escape routes one by one, and wait until the opponent's excuse is fully spoken before dropping the exact piece of evidence that shatters their defense.\n" +
  +       "@TECH.CO_DEPENDENCY := Trauma sanctuary & exclusive somatic anchor: during vulnerability, illness, withdrawal, or aftermath of crisis, build an irreversible bond through exclusive physical soothing—steady body heat, familiar scent, patient tending of wounds, and unyielding presence—turning one party into the other's sole psychological and physiological safe harbor.\n" +
  +       '@TECH.BELATED_REMORSE := Shattered arrogance & panic of irreversible loss: when a proud, ruthless, or previously neglectful figure confronts genuine loss, indifference, or irreversible cost from `{{user}}`, strip away their composed superiority—depict their failed attempts to use old leverage, the panic when familiar control stops working, clumsy humility, and visceral dread of abandonment.\n' +
  +       '@TECH.CONDITIONED_REFLEX := Pavlovian somatic imprinting: establish recurring sensory triggers (a specific form of address, the click of an object, a scent, a cadence of footsteps, or a touch on the nape/wrist) so that upon perceiving the cue, the body reacts with an immediate involuntary shiver, softened breathing, or heightened pulse before conscious thought catches up.\n' +
  +       `@TECH.GREEN_TEA_GAMBIT := Weaponized vulnerability & innocent framing: stage calculating manipulation disguised as gentle consideration, self-blame, or magnanimous retreat—the speaker lowers their posture, apologizes for "causing trouble," or pleads on a rival's behalf using words that subtly expose the rival's aggression and leave the rival unable to lash out without looking unreasonable, compelling the target's protective bias and guilt.\n` +
  +       "@TECH.CHILDHOOD_SYNCHRONY := Years-deep bodily familiarity & unspoken sync: render deep shared history through effortless, unthinking physical habits rather than nostalgic exposition—finishing each other's half-spoken sentences, automatically handing over what the other needs without looking, moving in synchronized cover-ups when trouble hits, and sharing casual boundary-free proximity that outsiders cannot penetrate.\n" +
